    narr:narration """The trajectory of the [decision capture feature](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has moved from a foundational product thesis established in March 2026 toward concrete implementation milestones reported in July 2026. The core product identity remains anchored in the [capture of decision artifacts](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) at the moment of consensus. Recent updates from July 2026 highlight the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784801427646_1) as a tangible realization of this goal. This progress is framed by a [technical unlock via the Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784801427646_3), which appears to correlate with a [peak in team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784801427646_2) for the quarter. The narrative currently tracks the transition from conceptual differentiation to operational execution.""" ;
